Bind Npc 25021 Zone 21

On greeting
    If quest 1223 is started
        Say "It's been too hard to come here crossing the continent. But did you see it too? There's a guy named Jed who's so handsome!"
        Topic "Big, shiny" do
            Say "(The ring sparkles radiantly when she opens the box) Wow...This is so beautiful... From Jed?"
            Topic "YesThe mind wants to convey." do
                Say "Oh...Thank you...but I need a man with courage. Tell him to bring this to me himself."
                Topic "(Suddenly appeared Jigsaw)" do
                    Say "Excuse me. Miss Amelie ... (clears throat)"
                    Topic "Next " do
                        Say "(Amelie's cheek turns in red) Oh. Jed!\nThank you for saving me from the monsters last time."
                        Topic "Next " do
                            Say "It was nothing. Well, I will be thankful if you accept this ring."
                            Topic "Next " do
                                Say "Why do I need to accept this ring?\n(Amelie being haughty)"
                                Topic "Next " do
                                    Say "B...Because. To get rid of those monsters...\n(Jed is bewildered)"
                                    Topic "Next " do
                                        Say "I...I lo..ve you! Since the first time I saw you."
                                        Topic "Next " do
                                            Say "Wh..what..(Amelie being shy)\nI will accept the ring...but first I will think about it."
                                            Topic "Next " do
                                                Say "Don't you need to go to Jed? *^^*"
                                                Topic "I got in the end! What is this girl?" do
                                                    Fulfil 1223
    Else if quest 1226 is started and player lacks 900609000
        Say "It's been too hard to come here crossing the continent. But did you see it too? There's a guy named Jed who's so handsome!"
        Topic "Amelie said yes" do
            Say "Oh. Welcome <selfname>. Jed is troubled? Haha He's waited long enough. Here. This is my response. Can you deliver it please?"
            Topic "I'll pass soon." do
                Transaction
                    Give 1 of 900609000
    Else if quest 1228 is started
        Say "It's been too hard to come here crossing the continent. But did you see it too? There's a guy named Jed who's so handsome!"
        Topic "The truth about Amelie" do
            Say "What brings you here today <selfname>?"
            Topic "I have undertaken to ask you something." do
                Say "What's the matter ^^? I will answer you to the best of my ability."
                Topic "I have undertaken to ask you something." do
                    Say "(Embarrassed) R.Right. I lost it the other day, Where did you find it?"
                    Topic "(At the burial ground)" do
                        Say "!!!!! \nI...I probably lost it when I went there to visit my father's grave. Thank God you found this for me..I was really sad about this."
                        Topic "(I'm right here.)" do
                            Say "(Amelie looks suspicious...That will do it for today)"
                            Topic "Confirm" do
                                Fulfil 1228
    Else
        Say "It's been too hard to come here crossing the continent. But did you see it too? There's a guy named Jed who's so handsome!"
